        <mxCell id="l1_scope_note" value="&lt;b&gt;Scope and role boundary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Staff record aggregate facility totals. MAO/Admin approve or return submissions. Staff correct only their own pending or returned records. Corrections reset the record to pending. Official report totals use approved records; history and CSV use visible records. Aggregate facility records do not change individual livestock inventory. Farmer-linked slaughter reconciliation is a separate workflow." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=18;fillColor=#fff8db;strokeColor=#c9a227;fontColor=#3f3b2b;fontSize=24;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=16.0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
